
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f6f2" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">
        trading<span>mind</span><span class="brand-dot">.</span>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#approach">Approach</a>
        <a href="#coaching">Coaching</a>
        <a class="nav-course" href="/course">Free course <span>↗</span></a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="https://x.com/youngtilopa" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          Get in touch <span>↗</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> ORGANIC INTELLIGENCE · TRADING</p>

          <h1>Trading puts your nervous system <em>under pressure.</em></h1>

          <p class="hero-subtitle">Develop the capacity to meet it.</p>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders navigating uncertainty, stress and
            the demands of high-performance decision-making.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#coaching">
              Explore coaching <span>↗</span>
            </a>
            <a class="text-link" href="/course">Explore the free course <span>→</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-aside" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="aside-rule"></div>
          <p class="aside-number">01 / 03</p>
          <p class="aside-label">PERFORMANCE<br />IS MORE THAN STRATEGY</p>
          <div class="aside-mark">
            <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro-section">
        <div class="section-index">01 <span>—</span> THE CHALLENGE</div>
        <div class="intro-content">
          <h2>You can know exactly what to do — and still struggle to do it.</h2>
          <div class="intro-body">
            <p>
              Trading asks a lot of you. Uncertainty, rapid decisions, volatility,
              wins, losses and the constant temptation to act can create a level
              of demand that is difficult to navigate.
            </p>
            <p>
              More discipline, better rules and another strategy may not address
              the whole problem. How you respond to pressure matters, too.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="approach-section" id="approach">
        <div class="section-index">02 <span>—</span> THE APPROACH</div>
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2>Build capacity,<br /><em>not just control.</em></h2>
          <p>
            The aim isn't to eliminate difficult experiences. It's to develop a
            greater capacity to meet them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="principles">
          <article class="principle">
            <p class="card-number">01</p>
            <h3>Understand your responses</h3>
            <p>
              Explore how pressure, uncertainty and activation shape your
              experience — without turning every reaction into a problem to fix.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="principle">
            <p class="card-number">02</p>
            <h3>Develop greater capacity</h3>
            <p>
              Build your ability to meet challenging experiences without relying
              exclusively on suppression, avoidance or willpower.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="principle">
            <p class="card-number">03</p>
            <h3>Make room for more choice</h3>
            <p>
              Develop a more flexible relationship with pressure, so difficult
              internal experiences don't have to dictate your next move.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="coaching-section" id="coaching">
        <div class="section-index">03 <span>—</span> ONE-TO-ONE COACHING</div>

        <div class="coaching-grid">
          <div class="coaching-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">WORK WITH THE PERSON BEHIND THE TRADER</p>
            <h2>How you meet the pressure is part of the <em>performance.</em></h2>
          </div>

          <div class="coaching-copy">
            <p>
              Organic Intelligence is a nervous-system-informed approach that
              emphasises orientation, connection and the development of capacity.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rather than trying to force yourself into the right state, we work
              with your experience as it unfolds. Sessions are tailored to you
              and the demands you're navigating.
            </p>
            <p>
              The focus is on your relationship with pressure, not on providing
              trading signals, strategies or financial advice.
            </p>

            <a class="button button-dark" href="https://x.com/youngtilopa" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              Reach out on X <span>↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section">
        <p class="eyebrow">START A CONVERSATION</p>
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>
        <p>
          Get in touch to talk about what you're experiencing and whether
          one-to-one coaching could be a fit.
        </p>
        <a class="button button-light" href="https://x.com/youngtilopa" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
          Get in touch <span>↗</span>
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/">trading<span>mind</span><span class="brand-dot">.</span></a>
      <p>Organic Intelligence for Traders</p>
      <p class="copyright">© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f7f6f2;
    --ink: #262822;
    --muted: #77796f;
    --olive: #858c70;
    --line: #deded5;
    --soft: #eeeee7;
  }

  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 100px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a), :global(a:visited) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--olive);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  .site-header {
    min-height: 86px;
    padding: 0 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: -1.25px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .brand > span:first-child { font-weight: 400; }
  .brand .brand-dot { color: var(--olive); font-weight: 700; }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 38px);
  }

  .nav-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    color: #55574f;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--olive); }

  .nav-links .nav-course { color: var(--ink); }

  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 575px;
    padding: 105px 7.2% 90px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 150px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-copy { max-width: 750px; }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 26px;
    color: var(--olive);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 1.7px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .eyebrow-line {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 23px;
    height: 1px;
    margin: 0 10px 3px 0;
    background: var(--olive);
  }

  h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(43px, 6.2vw, 77px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -4.4px;
    line-height: 1.07;
  }

  h1 em, h2 em {
    color: var(--olive);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.55px;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 23px;
  }

  .button {
    min-height: 47px;
    padding: 0 19px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 24px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
    transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-dark, .button-dark:visited {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff !important;
  }

  .button-dark:hover { background: #45483d; }

  .text-link, .text-link:visited {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }

  .text-link span { margin-left: 5px; color: var(--olive); }

  .hero-aside {
    align-self: end;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .aside-rule { width: 100%; height: 1px; margin-bottom: 15px; background: var(--line); }
  .aside-number { margin-bottom: 40px; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 1.4px; }
  .aside-label { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 1.4px; line-height: 1.9; }

  .aside-mark {
    height: 56px;
    margin-top: 27px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .aside-mark span {
    width: 5px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #a7ab96;
  }

  .aside-mark span:nth-child(1) { height: 18px; }
  .aside-mark span:nth-child(2) { height: 34px; }
  .aside-mark span:nth-child(3) { height: 49px; background: var(--olive); }
  .aside-mark span:nth-child(4) { height: 29px; }
  .aside-mark span:nth-child(5) { height: 14px; }

  .intro-section, .approach-section, .coaching-section {
    padding: 92px 7.2%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .section-index {
    margin-bottom: 42px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.45px;
  }

  .section-index span { margin: 0 7px; color: var(--olive); }

  .intro-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.72fr;
    gap: 12%;
    align-items: start;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.2vw, 50px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .intro-body { padding-top: 5px; color: var(--muted); }
  .intro-body p { margin-bottom: 18px; }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 54px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.62fr;
    gap: 9%;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .section-heading > p {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .principle {
    min-height: 225px;
    padding: 25px 28px 27px 0;
  }

  .principle + .principle {
    padding-left: 28px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .card-number {
    margin-bottom: 31px;
    color: var(--olive);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .principle h3 {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 550;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  .principle > p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .coaching-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.78fr;
    gap: 13%;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .coaching-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  .coaching-heading h2 { max-width: 520px; }
  .coaching-copy { padding-top: 4px; color: var(--muted); }
  .coaching-copy p { margin-bottom: 19px; }
  .coaching-copy .button { margin-top: 12px; }

  .contact-section {
    padding: 88px 7.2% 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 19px; }
  .contact-section h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 44px); }
  .contact-section > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin: 17px 0 27px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .button-light, .button-light:visited {
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .button-light:hover { background: var(--soft); }

  .site-footer {
    min-height: 83px;
    padding: 22px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .footer-brand { font-size: 18px; }
  .site-footer p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .site-header, .hero, .intro-section, .approach-section,
    .coaching-section, .contact-section, .site-footer {
      padding-left: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 6%;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 21px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 21px;
    }

    .nav-links a { font-size: 12px; }
    .nav-links .nav-cta { padding: 7px 10px; }

    .hero {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 76px 6% 66px;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 43px;
    }

    h1 { font-size: clamp(43px, 10vw, 65px); letter-spacing: -2.8px; }
    .hero-aside { display: none; }

    .intro-section, .approach-section, .coaching-section {
      padding: 66px 6%;
    }

    .section-index { margin-bottom: 29px; }

    .intro-content, .section-heading, .coaching-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .section-heading { margin-bottom: 36px; }

    .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .principle, .principle + .principle {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }

    .principle + .principle { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .card-number { margin-bottom: 17px; }

    .contact-section { padding: 70px 6%; }
    .site-footer { padding: 24px 6%; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .site-footer p { width: 100%; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    :global(*), :global(*::before), :global(*::after) { transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
